  "The page number «251» stands at the head of the page, centred, with a rule below it. At the foot, the signature «32*» on the right; recorded here, not transcribed as a line. Two columns divided by a vertical rule, as on pp. [249]-250 (JP2 0283-0284), transcribed column by column: the left column L01-L51, the right L52-L100; the letter heads «E.» (L25), «F.» (L56), «G.» (L64) and «H.» (L87) in bold, centred in their columns, each after a blank line; each entry begins at the edge of its column, its further lines indented, the subentries with a dash indented less.",
